{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00927","headline":"横吹曲辞 入关 · 张祜","name":"横吹曲辞 入关","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"都城连百二，雄险北回环。\n地势遥尊岳，河流侧让关。\n秦皇曾虎视，汉祖亦龙颜。\n何事枭凶辈，干戈自不闲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00927.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00927","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}